( https://albiononline.com/news/coming-to-europe )

Adventurer,

Albion Online will launch a *new server for the Europe and MENA regions* in=
 April 2024! This server will make the world of Albion more accessible than=
 ever for countless new and existing players. Along with offering *greatly =
improved connection speeds and ping* for players in the region, the new ser=
ver will also offer *optimized timers* for ingame events, as Albion's two n=
ewest languages, *Turkish and Arabic* , further expand Albion's global comm=
unity.

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DtzXrO7EupHk )

Here are the major features of the new server:

* A *fresh start* in an untouched version of the game, where all players st=
art as equals and can claim their own piece of Albion
* A game world that is *fully separate and independent* from the existing s=
ervers
* *Greatly improved connection speeds and ping* for the whole Europe / MENA=
 region
* Timings of *game events* (territory battles, Faction Warfare, etc.) that =
are *optimized for the region*
* Playable in *all of Albion's supported languages* , including the two new=
est additions: *Turkish* and *Arabic*

*Please note* that with the launch of Albion Europe, the two existing serve=
rs will be renamed:

* Albion West *=E2=86=92 Albion Americas*
* Albion East *=E2=86=92 Albion Asia*

For more information about servers, characters, and accounts, check out the=
 *official Albion Europe page* ( albiononline.com/europe ).

( https://albiononline.com/europe )

Founder Pack Sales Start March 11
---------------------------------

*Albion Europe* *Founder Packs* offer exclusive vanity items, early access =
to the new server, Gold, Premium, and access to the Closed Beta. They also =
offer *reservation of existing character and guild names* when you purchase=
 them. As your preferred character/guild names may exist on the previous se=
rvers, and can be claimed as soon as sales begin, we're giving a *one-week =
lead time* to make sure our community is aware of this. So, once Founder Pa=
ck sales begin on *Monday, March 11, 2024* at *11:00 UTC,* you'll want to a=
ct fast to make sure your preferred names are reserved!

( https://albiononline.com/europe )

You can check out the different levels of Founder Pack and the advantages t=
hat come with each on the *official Albion Europe page* ( albiononline.com/=
europe ) , and see the timelines for the Closed Beta, Open Beta, and Early =
Access phases:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/europe )

